### E2E Test Results

<p><strong>Test commit:</strong> {{.Commit}} | <strong>Controller commit:</strong> {{.ControllerCommit}} | <strong>Total duration:</strong> {{.Duration}}</p>
<p><strong>Controller resources:</strong> {{.Resources}}</p>
{{if .LogsUnavailable}}<p><strong>Controller logs:</strong> unavailable</p>
{{end}}
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Suite</th><th>Result</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Suites}}<tr>
<td><details>
<summary>{{.Name}} — {{.Passed}} passed, {{.Failed}} failed{{if .Skipped}}, {{.Skipped}} skipped{{end}}{{if .Pending}}, {{.Pending}} pending{{end}}</summary>
<ul>
{{range .Specs}}<li>{{.Result}} · {{.Name}} ({{.Duration}})</li>
{{end}}</ul>
</details></td>
<td>{{.Result}}</td><td>{{.Duration}}</td>
</tr>
{{end}}</tbody>
</table>
